sequenceDiagram
    actor V as Voter
    participant UI as Next.js Frontend
    participant W as MetaMask
    participant E as ethers.js
    participant SC as DecentraVote Contract
    participant BC as Blockchain

    V->>UI: Open Election Ballot Page
    UI->>E: getElection(electionId)
    E->>SC: getElection(electionId)
    SC-->>E: Election data
    E-->>UI: Display election + candidates
    
    UI->>E: getIsEligible(electionId, voterAddress)
    E->>SC: isEligibleVoter[electionId][voter]
    SC-->>E: true/false
    E-->>UI: Show eligibility status

    V->>UI: Select 1st Preference
    V->>UI: Select 2nd Preference (optional)
    V->>UI: Click "Review Ballot"
    UI->>UI: Display ballot summary

    V->>UI: Click "Submit Ballot"
    UI->>E: castBallot(electionId, pref1, pref2)
    E->>W: Request transaction signature
    W->>V: Show MetaMask popup
    V->>W: Approve & Sign

    W->>BC: Submit transaction
    BC->>SC: Execute castBallot()
    
    Note over SC: Validate:<br/>1. Election active<br/>2. Voter eligible<br/>3. Not already voted<br/>4. Valid candidates<br/>5. No duplicate prefs

    SC->>SC: Store ballot
    SC->>SC: Update primary tally
    SC->>SC: Update secondary tally (if pref2)
    SC->>BC: Emit BallotCast event

    BC-->>E: Transaction receipt
    E-->>UI: Confirmation + tx hash
    UI-->>V: "Ballot Submitted Successfully"
